---
description: Hide EU creatives from approval when the campaign already has a UK creative
alwaysApply: true
---

# UK creative covers EU

When a campaign has a UK creative, do not show EU creatives for approval.

- A UK creative has UK as its own token in the label or filename.
- An EU-only creative has EU as its own token and does not also have UK.
- If any UK creative is present, leave EU-only creatives off the review page, out of the approval count, and out of Approved, Needs Review, and At risk.
- If the campaign has no UK creative, keep the EU creatives on the page.
- A creative labeled for both UK and EU stays visible. It is the UK version.

Holiday Bauble Sale has UK McHome and UK McPO, so the EU McHome and EU McPO are not shown. Holiday Savings Spectacular has only EU creatives, so those stay.
